# ...but DO commit the four trained artifacts the app loads at runtime.
# Together they are ~38KB, and without them a fresh clone cannot predict.
!best_disease_model.pkl
!preprocessor.pkl
!label_encoder.pkl
!feature_names.pkl
*.h5
*.pth

